          "zh": "桑植—湘中—石阡—鸭池河—黔西—大定—毕节（红六军团）",
          "en": "Sangzhi–central Hunan–Shiqian–Yachihe–Qianxi–Dading–Bijie (Sixth Army Group)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "红六军团随红二、六军团主力由桑植突围，经湘中、湘西入黔，过石阡、鸭池河，进占黔西、大定、毕节。路线为示意，待按行军日志细化。",
          "en": "The Sixth Army Group moved with the main force from Sangzhi through central and western Hunan into Guizhou, past Shiqian and the Yachihe crossing, and occupied Qianxi, Dading, and Bijie. The route is schematic and awaits refinement from march logs."
