          "zh": "毕节—乌蒙山—盘县—普渡河—石鼓（红六军团）",
          "en": "Bijie–Wumeng Mountains–Panxian–Pudu River–Shigu (Sixth Army Group)"
        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "红六军团随主力撤离毕节，在乌蒙山区回旋，经盘县、普渡河、丽江石鼓渡金沙江。路线为示意，待按行军日志细化。",
          "en": "The Sixth Army Group withdrew from Bijie with the main force, maneuvered in the Wumeng Mountains, and moved via Panxian and the Pudu River to Shigu in Lijiang for the Jinsha River crossing. The route is schematic and awaits refinement from march logs."
